Stack

Next.js App Router 16.1.5 — NOT Pages Router. Critical for every routing and animation decision.
React 19.2.3
Tailwind CSS 4
Sanity CMS — projects at /projects/[slug]
Framer Motion — component-level animation only
GSAP + ScrollTrigger — scroll-driven effects, timelines, parallax
Lenis — smooth scroll
Embla — carousels
TypeScript strict mode
Vercel hosting, auto-deploy from GitHub main
Dev server: localhost:3002 always. Never 3000. Port set in package.json.

Animation Approaches
Page transitions: next-view-transitions package or CSS on template.tsx
Scroll animation: GSAP ScrollTrigger. Always use useGSAP from @gsap/react — never raw useEffect for GSAP.
Component animation: Framer Motion for hover states, mount/unmount, stagger reveals within a single page.
Text animation: GSAP SplitText with ScrollTrigger onEnter.
Simple hover states: CSS transitions.
Custom cursor: React component with mousemove + useState, no library.
Project Structure
/app/layout.tsx — global layout, edit with extreme care
/app/template.tsx — page transition wrapper
/app/globals.css — source of truth for all design tokens
/app/projects/[slug]/page.tsx — Sanity-powered project template
/components/LayoutShell.tsx — main shell wrapper, edit carefully
/lib/sanityImage.ts — always use this for Sanity image URLs
/lib/sanity.queries.ts — all GROQ queries live here
Design System
Clean, minimal, black and white. Work does the talking.
Typography is managed globally in globals.css. Never set font sizes, weights, line heights, or letter spacing inline or in component-level styles. If type needs to change, it changes in globals.css — nowhere else.

MCB Creative wordmark (hero + footer): ALWAYS Clash Display. Never change to another font. These are the only exceptions to the IBM Plex Mono headline rule.

Homepage about section (.about-blurb__text): uses --text-display-lg (larger). Info page (.info-page__text): uses --text-display-md (smaller). These are distinct — do not unify them.
Breakpoints: Mobile <768px / Tablet 768-1024px / Desktop >1024px.
Animation easing and duration values live in globals.css — use them, don't invent new ones.
Sanity
Always use next/image with sanityImage.ts URL builder. Never raw image URLs.
Schema: title, slug, client, role, year, description, heroImage, gallery, categories.
Standard to Meet
Every decision benchmarked against: would a senior developer at Metalab, Fantasy, or Instrument be comfortable with this code? If no, do it differently.
